.TH LM 1 "" "local-models"
.SH NAME
lm \- local models on this Mac: the front door to q, see, review, imagine and warm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lm
\(dqquestion\(dq | verb [args]
.br
.B lm
.RB [ \-\-capabilities ]
.br
.B lm how
\(dqwhat I want\(dq
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local models on this Mac. Nothing leaves the machine unless a command is marked as leaving it
(lm gemini, and q \-\-web).
.PP
Every command takes \-h. This page is generated from lib/verbs.toml, the same registry
that drives the lm screens, lm \-\-capabilities and lm how.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B lm \(dqquestion\(dq
A quick answer from the small local model.
.TP
.B lm cmd \(dqtask\(dq
One shell command, checked before you run it.
.TP
.B lm read <img|paste|latest> [\(dqq\(dq]
Text or an answer out of an image.
.TP
.B lm diff A B
What changed between two images.
.TP
.B lm doc <file> [\(dqq\(dq]
Ask about, or summarize, a file.
.TP
.B lm again [\-\-big|\-\-code|\-\-web]
The answer was wrong; ask the same thing on a stronger model.
.TP
.B lm find \(dqwords\(dq
Search the answers you got before.
.TP
.B lm review [PR|files|dir]
Review code, a PR or your uncommitted changes.
.TP
.B lm status [\-\-json]
What is loaded and what is free.
.TP
.B lm fast [1h|off]
Keep answers instant.
.TP
.B lm help [job]
The steps for one job.
.TP
.B lm more
Every command, including the rarely used ones.
.TP
.B lm how \(dqwhat I want\(dq [\-\-go] [\-\-json]
Find the command for what you want, without running it.
.TP
.B lm gemini \(dq...\(dq
The cloud lane: huge documents and web research. Leaves this Mac.
.TP
.B lm fleet <intent> [\-\-prompt P] files...
Ask one question of many independent files.
.TP
.B lm rag index|search|ask ...
Search exact text first, then by meaning.
.TP
.B lm index [find X]
Repo symbol map: build once, ask where a name is defined.
.TP
.B imagine \(dqprompt\(dq
Draw an image locally.
.TP
.B lm probe <model>
Judge whether a local model is trustworthy.
.TP
.B lm bench <set>
Run a fixed behavior and latency fixture set.
.TP
.B lm ui\-verify <img> \(dqclaim\(dq
Check claims about a screenshot against a UI inventory.
.TP
.B lm opencode [args]
Opencode on the local code model, leased for the session.
.TP
.B lm timeline [N] [\-\-errors] [\-\-tool T] [\-\-all] [\-\-json]
Your recent calls, newest last.
.TP
.B lm last [tool] [\-\-all]
Your latest call, in full.
.TP
.B lm models [\-\-json]
Installed models and which tier each is.
.TP
.B lm doctor [\-\-json]
Health check of the whole toolkit.
.TP
.B lm examples
A showcase of everything, grouped by job.
.TP
.B q [intent] \(dq<prompt>\(dq [\-\-big|\-\-code|\-\-web] [\-\-ctx FILE] [\-\-json]
Quick local LLM companion: answers, shell commands, commit messages, file Q&A.
.TP
.B see <image|paste|latest> [\(dqquestion\(dq] [\-\-ocr|\-\-ui] [\-\-json]
Read an image into text with a local vision model (the image never leaves this Mac).
.TP
.B warm on|off|status [tier|model] [time]
Keep a model loaded so q answers instantly, and say when it unloads.
.SH AGENT MENU
.TP
.B lm \-\-capabilities [job] [\-\-json]
Every job with its inputs, output shape, exit codes, cost and side effects.
.TP
.B lm how "what I want" [\-\-go] [\-\-json]
Find the command for a request. Words first, the small model only when no job matches.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B lm \(dqhow do I see what is using port 5432\(dq
The answer comes back in a few seconds.
.TP
.B lm cmd \(dqlist the 5 largest files in ~/Downloads\(dq
Prints the command and nothing else.
.TP
.B lm read shot.png
What is in the image.
.TP
.B lm diff before.png after.png
A three\-line summary: where, whether text changed, whether colours changed.
.TP
.B lm doc report.pdf
A summary (PDF, Word, HTML, text, spreadsheets).
.TP
.B lm again
Your last question, one step stronger (small, then big).
.TP
.B lm find \(dqport 5432\(dq
Matching questions and answers across q, see, gemini and imagine, yours first.
.TP
.B lm review
Your uncommitted changes (takes a few minutes; loads the 23 GB code model).
.TP
.B lm status
Server, free memory, loaded models, when they unload.
.TP
.B lm fast 1h
q answers in under a second until the time it prints.
.TP
.B lm help
The list of jobs.
.TP
.B lm more
The full command list.
.TP
.B lm how \(dqtext from my last screenshot\(dq
Prints the command, runs nothing.
.TP
.B lm gemini \-\-file big.md \(dqsummarize the risks\(dq
A file too big for the local model.
.TP
.B lm fleet qa \-\-prompt \(dqwho owns this?\(dq docs/*.md
Fan out across files.
.TP
.B lm index find fleet_worker
Where is X, no model call.
.TP
.B lm probe gemma4:26b
Run the reliability eval on one model.
.TP
.B lm bench quick
Fixed correctness, latency, disk workload.
.TP
.B lm ui\-verify shot.png \(dqthe CTA is disabled\(dq
Strict pass/fail/unsure gate.
.TP
.B lm opencode
Start opencode with the code model loaded, released when you exit.
.TP
.B lm timeline
Your last 20 calls across q, see, imagine, fleet and gemini.
.TP
.B lm last
Your newest call, in full.
.TP
.B lm models
Installed models, which are loaded, and which tier each fills.
.TP
.B lm doctor
One pass or fail line per dependency; exits 1 if any fail.
.TP
.B lm examples
Real commands you can paste, grouped by job.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The work ran and failed, or a check failed.
.TP
.B 2
Bad usage: unknown flag, missing value, unknown verb.
.TP
.B 10
Server down or a backend call failed.
.TP
.B 11
Model or backend not available.
.TP
.B 12
Input missing or unreadable (file, image, history entry, optional dependency).
.TP
.B 13
Wall\-clock timeout.
.TP
.B 127
A required program is not installed.
.TP
.B 130
Cancelled by the caller.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B logs/*\-history.jsonl
One JSON line per call. History is per terminal by default; \-\-all or LM_ALL=1 reaches every caller.
.SH SEE ALSO
q(1), see(1), warm(1), imagine, review
